OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment will not provide
OL,4,Afunding for #55m road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has confirmed it will
OL,7,Fnot fund a #55m relief road despite it
OL,8,Fbeing granted planning permission.
OL,10,FThe Blyth Relief Road was proposed to
OL,11,Falleviate congestion through the
OL,12,Fconstruction of a new dual carriageway
OL,13,Fconnecting two of the town's busiest
OL,14,Froads.
OL,16,FNorthumberland County Council's
OL,17,FConservative administration criticised
OL,18,Fthe decision, but the Department for
OL,19,FTransport (DfT) said the project was
OL,20,Fnot funded by the previous government.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
