OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment will not provide
OL,4,Afunding for #55m road
OL,5,
OL,6,FA DfT spokesperson said: "Given the
OL,7,Fchallenging financial picture we
OL,8,Finherited, we have had to make
OL,9,Fdifficult decisions on a number of road
OL,10,Fprojects and can only progress schemes
OL,11,Fthat are good value for money for
OL,12,Ftaxpayers."
